                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A short and repetative wave \"shooter\" with spells instead of guns. The environment is beautiful but enemy graphics are underwelming and with little variation. Spells are not cast with your hands as in Waltz of the Wizard, but shot with the vive controler trigger. This makes casting spells less like actually casting, more like using a regular gun. This game has potential, but I would not reccomend it in its current state.",
